{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location="Eternal Holy City" Okhema|Aglaea shows sincere gratitude for our help in defeating Nikador, preparing generous gifts and inviting (Trailblazer) and I to the Hero's Bath for a discussion.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Unused &mdash; EnterDistrict_G233)
----
::Now, in your private bath chamber
::Ever since the battle with {{Rubi|Nikador|Strife Titan}}, you haven't slept so soundly in ages.
::Even if Death itself came to rouse you, you'd proudly retort: Why does life slumber? Because the bed is warm...
::Yet, a chill from the River of Souls wafted by, a sensation hauntingly familiar. Could Death truly be at your door?
::Best to open your eyes, just in case...
::'''Castorice:''' {{MC|м=Mr.|ж=Miss}} (Trailblazer), you're awake.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} ...No wonder I felt a chill.
:::'''Castorice:''' Is the room too cold?
:::...Castorice, why does life slumber?
:::'''Castorice:''' ...That's a complicated question. I'm not sure I can answer that.
:::...Why are you here?
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} ...Castorice, why does life slumber?
:::'''Castorice:''' ...That's a complicated question. I'm not sure I can answer that.
:::...Why are you here?
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} ...Why are you here?
::'''Castorice:''' I apologize for arriving uninvited. I saw that you were still asleep, so I took the liberty of waiting nearby.
::'''Castorice:''' I bring a message from Lady Aglaea. She has prepared a gift for you and Dan Heng, and wishes to present it to you in person.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} A gift? Gimme, gimme!
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What are we waiting for? Let's go!
::'''Castorice:''' I'm glad you're in good spirits. Alright, let's set off.
