:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Is Aglaea's nickname Aglie?
::'''Aglaea:''' Hehe...
::'''Castorice:''' Mis&mdash;!
::'''Hyacine:''' Wah! You can't say that! Lady Aglaea should always be "Lady Aglaea"!
:'''Dan Heng:''' This girl... She's a natural at making friends.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} She reminds me of an old friend with pink hair.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} So am I!
::'''Dan Heng:''' I'll let you take it from here, then.
:'''Hyacine:''' Hehe, as an acolyte of {{Rubi|Aquila|Sky Titan}}, I'm here to bring healing light to the world. Plus, I've heard you're also children of the distant skies! Fate must have brought us together!
:'''Hyacine:''' Can we be friends? I'd love to hear your tales of the sky! And ooh, it's a rare occasion that Okhema presents such an invaluable gift to guests. Lady Aglaea, may I have the honor of tasting it, too?
:'''Aglaea:''' Of course you may. Esteemed guests of Okhema, please believe me when I say that this gift carries no hidden agendas. As for the matter of the alliance, you need not give me an answer here and now.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Well, if you insist...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Ohh, she's here to help Aglaea recruit us.
::'''Hyacine:''' Haha, you're mistaken! The capable Lady Aglaea doesn't need my help with things like this.
:'''Dan Heng:''' ...I see. In that case, we will accept this gift from Okhema. We welcome the chance to talk with you, Lady Hyacine.
:{{tx}}
----
:'''Hyacine:''' Well, it looks like everything's sorted out now! The patients have also all recovered. I think it's time for me to head back, Lady Aglaea.
:'''Aglaea:''' I would love to keep you in Okhema for a few more days, but I would hate to provoke the ire of the Grove.
:'''Aglaea:''' As it happens, Okhema intends to send a messenger to the Grove for updates about the research on the black tide. We also want to communicate our desire to discuss the retrieval of {{Rubi|Cerces'|Reason Titan}} Coreflame at the earliest convenience.
