===Speak with Castorice and Hyacine and prepare to head out{{subst:void|<!--104020404-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location="Eternal Holy City" Okhema|update|During alliance negotiations with Aglaea, we encounter Hyacine from the Twilight Courtyard. (Trailblazer) and Castorice opt to join her journey back to the Grove to complete Aglaea's diplomatic mission.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Talk to Castorice)
----
:'''Castorice:''' I'm glad to be in your company again, {{MC|м=Mr.|ж=Miss}} (Trailblazer).
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} Tell me about the Titan known as Thanatos.
::'''Castorice:''' {{Rubi|Thanatos|Death Titan}}... controls my fate, in a sense. The curse I bear came from them.
::'''Castorice:''' And they have something of mine... something of great importance that I must get back from them.
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} Who is Professor Anaxa?
::'''Castorice:''' When I was studying at the Grove alongside Phainon and the others, Professor Anaxa was responsible for teaching us about the Chrysos Heirs and the Titans. That's also when I met Miss Hyacine... She was Anaxa's teaching assistant then.
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} What is the Grove of Epiphany?
::'''Castorice:''' The Grove of Epiphany is Okhema's partner academy. They look after the Coreflame of {{Rubi|Cerces|Reason Titan}} and are the organization at the forefront of researching phenomena such as the black tide and the Titans. They also provide academic research support for the Flame-Chase Journey.
::'''Castorice:''' Several Chrysos Heirs are based in the Grove, including Miss Hyacine and Professor Anaxa.
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I don't have any more questions. Let's go!
::'''Hyacine:''' I came here with a colleague from the Twilight Courtyard. I've asked her to pack her luggage in advance, so she's already waiting for us by the city gates. Let's go meet up with her!
