===Keep going and investigate the cause of the calamity{{subst:void|<!--104020458-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location="Murmuring Woods" Grove of Epiphany|update|Black tide creations roaming throughout the Grove... this doesn't bode well. In this calamity, the Grove's fate looks grim. After reporting to Aglaea, (Trailblazer)'s group continues deeper into the Grove to investigate.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Unused &mdash; EnterDistrict_G{GroupID})
----
::'''Trianne:''' Everything will be fine! The people at the Grove are really smart. They'll definitely be able to chase away the black tide!
::'''Mem:''' Aglaea said that Anaxa is still alive. If that's true, then there's still hope for everyone else too...
::'''Mem:''' Who is this Anaxa anyway? Why does everybody seem to have some kind of trust in him?
::'''Castorice:''' How should I put it...
::'''Castorice:''' Lady Aglaea doesn't "trust" Anaxa at all, I'm afraid.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} He sounds like a big shot.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Ah... That makes complete sense...
:::'''Mem:''' Hm? Were you in a similar situation before, friend?
:::'''Castorice:''' Believe me, she is far nicer to the two of you than she is to Anaxa.
::'''Castorice:''' Despite being a Chrysos Heir, Anaxa resolutely believes that Titans and prophecies are a load of nonsense.
::{{tx}}

;(Unused &mdash; EnterDistrict_G{GroupID})
:'''Mem:''' I wonder if I'll find any memories.
{{Dialogue End}}

===Open the gate and continue forward{{subst:void|<!--104020461-->}}===
{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Talk to Investigate)
:{{tx}}
:'''Castorice:''' I can't open it... It was probably sealed in order to ward off the black tide.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} There's no keyhole in this door...
::'''Castorice:''' Yes, most of the doors on Amphoreus are sealed using the power of {{Rubi|Janus|Passage Titan}}.
::Flaming lance, chaaaarge!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Flaming lance, chaaaarge!
:'''Castorice:''' Save your energy. {{Rubi|Janus|Passage Titan}}'s power... is far stronger than we could ever imagine.
:'''Mem:''' Since this door is a creation of the Three Titans of Fate, maybe the eyes of {{Rubi|Oronyx|Time Titan}} will help me find a way to open it...
:{{tx}}
----
:'''Mem:''' H&mdash;He disappeared again? Did he finish what he wanted to say?
:'''Castorice:''' {{MC|м=Mr.|ж=Miss}} (Trailblazer), judging from your reaction, you must have found a useful memory.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} (Recount what you saw in the memory)
:'''Castorice:''' Professor Anaxa? That's a lot to digest at once... I'm sorry, please give me some time.
:{{tx}}
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} He said his name is Anaxagoras.
::'''Castorice:''' ...You don't have to take that too seriously. For some reason, he's especially particular about his full name.
::{{tx}}
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} Nousporists and alchemy refer to...
::'''Castorice:''' Professor Anaxa theorizes that all beings originate from the same source and have a similar composition, which in this case refers to the soul. He calls this theory Nousporism...
::{{tx}}
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} Everyone seems to have been evacuated.
::'''Castorice:''' Yes, that seems like the only good news so far. We can just focus on retrieving the Coreflame then.
::{{tx}}
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} Perhaps Anaxa... did not manage to survive.
::'''Castorice:''' I... do not wish to consider this possibility.
::{{tx}}
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} We have to go to the Luminary Throne.
::'''Mem:''' The {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|Luminary Throne}}? What sort of place is that? Why would there be a throne in an academy?
::{{tx}}
::{{tx}}
{{Dialogue End}}

===Keep moving forward and head to the Luminary Throne{{subst:void|<!--104020419-->}}===
{{Dialogue Start}}
