:A despicable, twisted life form &mdash; it was once a living soul that could mourn pain, but now it can only turn its head at others, until its soul drifts silently out of its shell.
:'''Mem:''' Maybe this monster will show us some useful memories...
:'''Mem:''' ...
:'''Mem:''' I shouldn't have gotten my hopes up.
